>>> describe_op {"op":"cube"}
prim.box (Box): Creates a box with optional rounded or chamfered edges and groups top, bottom, front, back, left, right.

Creates a mesh box at real size. The origin sits at the bottom center by default so the box stands on the ground.

**Use for** crates, cabinets, walls, panels, blockouts. Add `bevel` for hard-surface props: 1 segment (chamfer) for small props, 2 to 3 for hero assets; widths of 3 to 10 mm read well on 0.5 to 1 m props.

**Groups:** `top`, `bottom`, `front` (+Z), `back`, `left` (-X), `right` (+X), and `bevel` when beveled. Edges between groups are marked sharp.

**Not for** round shapes (use `prim.cylinder` or `prim.quad_sphere`).

aliases: cube, add cube, rounded box, chamfer box, polyCube
complexity: O(faces): segments products plus bevel segments times edge segments
parameters (JSON Schema): {"$defs":{"BevelParams":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Bevel of a box's edges.","properties":{"segments":{"default":1,"description":"Segments across the bevel: 1 is a flat chamfer (one triangle per\ncorner), 2 or more rounds it (even counts give quads only).","format":"uint32","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"width":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Length","description":"Bevel radius; less than half the smallest box size."}},"required":["width"],"type":"object"},"BoxAdvanced":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Advanced box settings.","properties":{"segments":{"default":[1,1,1],"description":"Quads along X, Y and Z on each flat face.","items":{"format":"uint32","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"maxItems":3,"minItems":3,"type":"array"}},"type":"object"},"Length":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"pattern":"^\\s*[-+]?(\\d+\\.?\\d*|\\.\\d+)([eE][-+]?\\d+)?\\s*(mm|cm|dm|m|km|in|ft)?\\s*$","type":"string"}],"description":"Length: meters as a number, or a string with a unit (mm, cm, dm, m, km, in, ft), e.g. \"30cm\"."},"OriginParam":{"description":"Where a primitive's origin sits.","oneOf":[{"const":"center","description":"Bounding box center.","type":"string"},{"const":"bottom","description":"Center of the bottom: the object stands on the ground plane.","type":"string"}]}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"description":"Parameters of `prim.box`.","properties":{"advanced":{"$ref":"#/$defs/BoxAdvanced","default":{"segments":[1,1,1]},"description":"Rarely needed settings."},"bevel":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/BevelParams"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"description":"Rounded or chamfered edges; sharp when omitted."},"depth":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Length","default":1.0,"description":"Size along Z (back to front)."},"height":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Length","default":1.0,"description":"Size along Y (bottom to top)."},"name":{"default":null,"description":"Object name; a free name such as `box_1` is picked when omitted.","type":["string","null"]},"origin":{"$ref":"#/$defs/OriginParam","default":"bottom","description":"Origin at the bottom center (stands on the ground) or the center."},"parent":{"default":null,"description":"Parent object (name, path or id); top level when omitted.","type":["string","null"]},"position":{"default":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"description":"Origin position in the parent's space.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Length"},"maxItems":3,"minItems":3,"type":"array"},"width":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Length","default":1.0,"description":"Size along X (left to right)."}},"title":"BoxParams","type":"object"}
defaults: {"advanced":{"segments":[1,1,1]},"bevel":null,"depth":1.0,"height":1.0,"name":null,"origin":"bottom","parent":null,"position":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"width":1.0}
example: {"name": "crate", "width": 0.6, "height": 0.6, "depth": 0.6, "bevel": {"width": "8mm", "segments": 2}} -> created crate (o:1) box 0.6 x 0.6 x 0.6 m: 54 faces (108 tris; budget 6,000)
example: {"width": "4m", "height": "3m", "depth": "20cm"} -> created box (o:1) box 4 x 3 x 0.2 m: 6 faces (12 tris; budget 6,000)

